## Key Concepts

- Data residency and tenant isolation
- Region-bound storage and access controls
- Serverless analytics stack (Lambda, Glue, Athena/Redshift)
- Automated onboarding/offboarding (CDK/Terraform)
- Cross-region dashboards and DR strategy (RTO/RPO)

